    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>8级 杂兵 蛮战</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 野兽（盲目，泥型怪）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +6</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 20，''强韧'' 22，''反射'' 20，''意志'' 18</span><span>''侦查'' +4</span></div>\n<div><span>''免疫'' 目盲，凝视效果；''抗力'' 15 强酸</span><span>''感官'' 震动感知 10</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 4，攀爬 3</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">泥型</div>\n<div class=description>在挤过时，该黑布丁之卵以完整的速度移动而不是半速，它的攻击骰不会受到-5 减值，且<br>它不会因挤过而提供战斗优势。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}击打（强酸）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+12vs.强韧<br>命中：10 强酸伤害，且该黑布丁之卵快步最多其速度。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 15（+6）</span><span>''敏捷'' 14（+6）</span><span>''感知'' 11（+4）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 19（+8）</span><span>''智力'' 1（-1）</span><span>''魅力'' 1（-1）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span></div></div>\n</div>",
